  "text_pages": [
    "First Online Meeting With Your Academic Advisor | Tohoku University\nFirst Online Meeting With Your Academic Advisor\nInstructions for JYPE,  COLABS, and DEEP Students\n(Last updated: June 9, 2025)\nTOP\n>\nFor International Students\n>\nExchange Programs\n>\nInformation for Incoming Exchange Students (Top)\n>\nFirst Online Meeting With Your Academic Advisor\nAction\nSchedule\nNote\nContact\nPurpose\nExchange students in the JYPE, DEEP, and COLABS programs should have a first online meeting with their academic advisor for the following reasons:\n- To introduce yourself\n- To learn about your academic advisor and laboratory\n- To ensure your study field and research theme\n- To discuss your study plan for the semester (i.e. study/research theme, elective courses)\nAction\n- Email to Academic Advisor\nEmail title:  “First Online Meeting Arrangement (\nProgram / Your Name\n)”\nYour email should include the following topics:\n(1) Self-Introduction\n(including Applicant ID/Name/Program/Home University etc.)\n(2) Availability Request\nfor the online meeting arrangement\n(3) First day to visit the lab\n; inform the expected date of your arrival on campus and ask them when the good day/time is to visit the lab for the first time.\nSchedule\nSemester\nEvent\nDate\nFall\nSemester\nEmail to Academic Advisor for Availability Request\nby Mid Sep.\nProgram Orientation\nSeptember 28\nRefer to Academic Calendar:\nJYPE\n/\nCOLABS\n/\nDEEP\n- Tohokudai ID Activation\n- Semester Begins\n- Course Registration Period Begins\nOct. 1\nFirst Online Meeting\nby Sep. 20\nDeadline for Course Registration\nOct. 14\nSemester Ends\nFeb. 5\nSemester\nEvent\nDate\nSpring\nSemester\nEmail to Academic Advisor for Availability Request\nby Mid Mar.\nProgram Orientation\nEarly April\nRefer to Academic Calendar:\nJYPE\n/\nCOLABS\n/\nDEEP\n- Tohokudai ID Activation\n- Semester Begins\nApr. 1\nCourse Registration Period Begins\nEarly Apr.\nFirst Online Meeting\nby  Mar. 20\nDeadline for Course Registration\nMid Apr.\nSemester Ends\nEarly Aug.\nPlease note: This schedule with your academic advisor is intended as a guideline and may be modified to suit your individual circumstances.\nNote\n✔ Be simple\n✔ Be respectful\n✔ Be specific\nAnd...\n✔ Wait for a while\neven if you cannot confirm an immediate response\n✔ Contact your academic advisor\nif you need to re-schedule\nthe online meeting\nContact\n- For General Questions\nIncoming Student Exchange Section\nStudent Exchange Division\nTohoku University\nContact Form\n/ studyab ＠ grp.tohoku.ac.jp"
  ],
